CM_ BO_ 1040 "Intercom Status (Std ID 0x410). Period 100ms. Direction Bidirectional. Displays status for audio, BT/WiFi, PTT, volumes and brightness.";
CM_ BO_ 1041 "Intercom Command 0(Std ID 0x411). Period 100ms. Commands for beep, volumes, PTT, filters, modules and call control.";
CM_ BO_ 1042 "Intercom Command 1(Std ID 0x412). Period 100ms. Commands for secondary menu controls.";
CM_ SG_ 1041 CMD_SoundBeepPlay "Command: set 1 to execute once, then set 0 (explicit reset required).";
CM_ SG_ 1041 CMD_DriverVolume_UP "Command: set 1 to execute once, then set 0 (explicit reset required).";
CM_ SG_ 1041 CMD_DriverVolume_Down "Command: set 1 to execute once, then set 0 (explicit reset required).";
CM_ SG_ 1041 CMD_Radio_Tx "Level-based: 0=Off, 1=On (persistent state).";
CM_ SG_ 1041 CMD_CoDriverVolume_Up "Command: set 1 to execute once, then set 0 (explicit reset required).";
CM_ SG_ 1041 CMD_CoDriverVolume_Down "Command: set 1 to execute once, then set 0 (explicit reset required).";
