CM_ SG_ 1041 CMD_BT_Module_OnOff "Level-based: 0=Off, 1=On (persistent state).";
CM_ SG_ 1041 CMD_WiFi_Module_OnOff "Level-based: 0=Off, 1=On (persistent state).";
CM_ SG_ 1041 CMD_Answer_Incoming_Call "Command: set 1 to answer call, then set 0 (explicit reset required).";
CM_ SG_ 1041 CMD_HangUp_Incoming_Call "Command: set 1 to hang up call, then set 0 (explicit reset required).";
CM_ SG_ 1041 CMD_Intercom_Default_Setting "Command: set 1 to apply defaults, then set 0 (explicit reset required).";
